{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-44","kind":"proposition","title":"在给定线段上构造与三角形等面积的平行四边形","englishTitle":"To a given straight line to apply, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given triangle.","book":1,"number":44,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":44,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","contentId":"euclid-1-44","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16a2d33057e6af136ac1bf7bb76e0382246e398ac80d3602784f09ad204e5553","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-44.statement","euclid-1-44.construction.1","euclid-1-44.construction.2","euclid-1-44.construction.3","euclid-1-44.proof.1","euclid-1-44.construction.4","euclid-1-44.proof.2","euclid-1-44.proof.3","euclid-1-44.proof.4","euclid-1-44.proof.5","euclid-1-44.conclusion","euclid-1-44.historical.1","euclid-1-44.historical.2","euclid-1-44.historical.3","euclid-1-44.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-44.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2dbe71c13935fd3c418873e1e0fa5329c5bac0dd5ff5346ac84455a5f58adfaa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To a given straight line to apply, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个指定的直线角度上,对指定的直线应用一个平行四边形等于一个指定的三角形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上求作平行方形与所设三角形等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上，找到与给定三角形相等的平行四边形，以及与正方形的角度相等的角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2c150311dfd66ce232ab058298bb04c6384a5606c1d2740601e514e14f7750d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, C the given triangle and D the given rectilineal angle; thus it is required to apply to the given straight line AB, in an angle equal to the angle D, a parallelogram equal to the given triangle C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB为给定直线,C为给定三角形,D为给定直线角;因此,它必须适用于给定直线AB, 角度等于角D, 平行四边形等于给定三角形C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5518a68ea368295d62531b0df3ffc785ea53c71f5206aecf49babf6410bc57ec","citations":["euclid-1-42","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the parallelogram BEFG be constructed equal to the triangle C, in the angle EBG which is equal to D [[I. 42](/principles/euclid-1-42)]; let it be placed so that BE is in a straight line with AB; letFG be drawn through to H, and let AH be drawn through A parallel to either BG or EF. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平行四边形 BEFG 的构造等于三角形C,角度EBG,等于D;将其置于BE直线AB;将FG拖到H,将AH拖到A,与BG或EF平行。 [[I. 42](/principles/euclid-1-42)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b935dc5c1024d411aafeebced7ac8732c4ae4f5532e3693ec4fe15c2ddec599d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let HB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HB合二为一"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7342a31a45627c2ab7848dddb87ab6ddab6f89aa7cf26321acd039bc32c88e50","citations":["euclid-1-29","euclid-1-post-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line HF falls upon the parallels AH, EF, the angles AHF, HFE are equal to two right angles. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] Therefore the angles BHG, GFE are less than two right angles; and straight lines produced indefinitely from angles less than two right angles meet; [[Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)] therefore HB, FE, when produced, will meet."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线HF横线相交AH、EF、AHF、HFE等角等于2 直角。 因此,BHG、GFE等角小于2 直角;直线从小于2 直角的角线无限期延伸;因此,HB、FE等角延伸后,将相交。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7aa356abb431b744939b5eb4213ffa65ef3bd18b2e1db14c1b698b9f44425d80","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them be produced and meet at K; through the point K let KL be drawn parallel to either EA or FH, [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)] and let HA, GB be produced to the points L, M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"K时延长,相交;K时KL分与EA或FH点平行,HA时GB分与L分平行。（相关点与线段：M） [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cb44845b9519f6354817515c948f8b0fc311babbd31ed14060e32f04b8183f24","citations":["euclid-1-43"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then HLKF is a parallelogram, HK is its diameter, and AG, ME are parallelograms. and LB, BF the so-called complements, about HK; therefore LB is equal to BF. [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HLKF是对角线平行四边形,HK,AG,ME是平行四边形。 LB,BF是所谓的补丁,约HK;因此,LB等于BF。 [[I. 43](/principles/euclid-1-43)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"934a89393c8fa1b902c39da0f6e8c7be5a02ce78bae08890492f3c2ba126a935","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BF is equal to the triangle C; therefore LB is also equal to C. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BF等于C三角形,因此LB也等于C。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9b9fbc51673aec3ad6d74617a9329a688943abe899d0342e952fd4ee11c0126","citations":["euclid-1-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle GBE is equal to the angle ABM, [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] while the angle GBE is equal to D, the angle ABM is also equal to the angle D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于GBE角等于ABM角,而GBE角等于D角,ABM角也等于D角。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca727767d8b0e486b27559523f4371c9c198f26fe98138345ddc241c4fdf0c13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the parallelogram LB equal to the given triangle C has been applied to the given straight line AB, in the angle ABM which is equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在ABM角,即D角,对给定的直线AB应用了相当于给定三角形C的平行四边形 LB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6a234cf1bd2a3a003ab7ee301e957a43fb9cc5822f69fc6e6e211571b5de8c5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线上求作平行方形与所设三角形等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一条直线上，找到与给定三角形相等的平行四边形，以及与正方形的角度相等的角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d648c06893ce66e738798a1369cbcc5659b834d30389542cce0277a3df82511e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：设甲线乙角形丙角求于甲线上作平行方形与乙角形等而有丙角先作丁戊己庚平行方形与乙角形等而戊己庚角与丙角等〈本篇四二〉次于庚己线引长之作己辛线与甲等次作辛壬线与戊己平行〈本篇三一〉次于丁戊引长之与辛壬线遇于壬次自壬至己作对角线引出之又自丁庚引长之与对线角遇于癸次自癸作直线与庚辛平行又于壬辛引长之与癸线遇于子末于戊己引长之至癸子线得丑即己丑子辛平行方形如所求"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘图方法如下:::在 甲 上找到直线 甲、三角形 乙、角度 丙，构造平行四边形和与三角形 乙 相等的三角形，并首先构造角度 丙；平行四边形和三角形 乙 等于 丁戊己庚；三角形等于 戊己庚 和 丙；〈本篇四二〉 紧挨 庚己 线，延伸到 己辛 和 甲，然后与 辛壬 平行并与 戊己 平行；〈本篇三一〉 紧挨 和 丙 紧挨 丙，丙 紧挨 丙，丙 紧挨 戊己庚 和 庚己。线 己辛 和 甲 与 甲 平行，然后线 辛壬 与 戊己 平行；〈本篇三一〉 紧挨 到 丙。〈本篇四二〉 紧挨 庚己 线并延伸，己辛 线平行于 甲，然后线 辛壬 平行于 戊己；〈本篇三一〉 平行于 甲8 至 甲。034 将线延伸到 辛壬 并与 壬 相交，从 壬 到 己 画一条对角线，然后从 丁庚 在角度上延伸到 癸，从 癸 画一条与 庚辛 平行的直线，然后从 壬辛 延伸与 癸4 相交，并在 戊己 末端延伸到 癸子、丑，即 己丑子辛，形成所需的平行四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a888b31b3ecee24683e7b6433673ec3f4ff883cc8d1346ccb05e4f653bede27a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：此方形之己辛线与甲等而辛己丑角为戊己庚之交角〈本篇十五〉则与丙等又本形与戊己庚丁同为馀方形等〈本篇四三〉则与乙角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：在此正方形中，线 己辛 等于 甲，辛己丑 的角度是 戊己庚 的交角，因此 〈本篇十五〉 等于 丙。原始图形和 戊己庚丁 也是互补正方形，〈本篇四三〉 等于 乙，且三角形等于 乙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-44.source","contentId":"euclid-1-44","revisionId":"euclid-1-44@raw-16a2d33057e6af13","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b41cf9031bab11cd197872f82688261ca63b42a67134167486c3cc36190e98b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-44:euclid-1-42:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-44","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-44.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-42","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44/","sourceLabel":"I. 42"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-44:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-44","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-44.construction.2","euclid-1-44.construction.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.44/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-44:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":